          "line2": "it fight!"
        }
      ],
      "5_DeliverParcel": [
        {
          "line1": "OAK: Oh, <PLAYER>!",
          "line2": ""
        },
        {
          "line1": "How is my old",
          "line2": "POKeMON?"
        },
        {
          "line1": "Well, it seems to",
          "line2": "like you a lot."
        },
        {
          "line1": "You must be",
          "line2": "talented as a"
        },
        {
          "line1": "POKeMON trainer!",
          "line2": ""
        },
        {
          "line1": "What? You have",
          "line2": "something for me?"
        },
        {
          "line1": "<PLAYER> delivered",
          "line2": "OAK's PARCEL."
        }
      ],
      "5_ParcelThanks": [
        {
          "line1": "Ah! This is the",
          "line2": "custom POKe BALL"
        },
        {
          "line1": "I ordered!",
          "line2": "Thank you!"
        }
      ],
      "5_PokemonAroundTheWorld": [
        {
          "line1": "POKeMON around the",
          "line2": "world wait for"
        },
        {
          "line1": "you, <PLAYER>!",
          "line2": ""
        }
      ],
      "5_GivePokeballs": [
        {
          "line1": "OAK: You can't get",
          "line2": "detailed data on"
        },
        {
          "line1": "POKeMON by just",
          "line2": "seeing them."
        },
        {
          "line1": "You must catch",
          "line2": "them! Use these"
        },
        {
          "line1": "to capture wild",
          "line2": "POKeMON."
        },
        {
          "line1": "<PLAYER> got 5",
          "line2": "POKe BALLs!"
        }
      ],
      "5_PokeballsExplanation": [
        {
          "line1": "When a wild",
          "line2": "POKeMON appears,"
        },
        {
          "line1": "it's fair game.",
          "line2": ""
        },
        {
          "line1": "Just throw a POKe",
          "line2": "BALL at it and try"
        },
        {
          "line1": "to catch it!",
          "line2": ""
        },
        {
          "line1": "This won't always",
          "line2": "work, though."
        },
        {
          "line1": "A healthy POKeMON",
          "line2": "could escape. You"
        },
        {
          "line1": "have to be lucky!",
          "line2": ""
        }
      ],
      "5_ComeSeeMeSometimes": [
        {
          "line1": "OAK: Come see me",
          "line2": "sometimes."
        },
        {
          "line1": "I want to know how",
          "line2": "your POKeDEX is"
        },
        {
          "line1": "coming along.",
          "line2": ""
        }
      ],
      "5_HowIsYourPokedexComing": [
        {
          "line1": "OAK: Good to see",
          "line2": "you! How is your"
        },
        {
          "line1": "POKeDEX coming?",
          "line2": "Here, let me take"
        },
        {
          "line1": "a look!",
          "line2": ""
        }
      ],
      "6": [
        {
          "line1": "It's encyclopedia-",
          "line2": "like, but the"
        },
        {
          "line1": "pages are blank!",
          "line2": ""
